  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HRF is a local humanitarian fund that is administrated by OCHA. UN Agencies and NGOs can apply for resources from this fund for humanitarian projects. It supports about 20 % of the Non food humanitarian aid in Ethiopia each year.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HRF &#xe4;r en lokal fond, d&#xe4;r de humanit&#xe4;ra akt&#xf6;rerna p&#xe5; plats g&#xf6;r bed&#xf6;mningar om det humanit&#xe4;ra l&#xe4;get och d&#xe4;refter allokerar medel till olika humanit&#xe4;ra akt&#xf6;rer</narrative>
